---
import InnerLayout from '../layouts/InnerLayout.astro';
---

<InnerLayout
  title="Company | EVO"
  description="Learn about EVO, a Sri Lankan engineering and technology company focused on automation, smart environments and custom technical systems."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <div class="page-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT EVO</p>
        <h1>Built in Sri Lanka. <span class="green-accent">Engineered to grow beyond it.</span></h1>
        <p>EVO brings industrial engineering, automation, smart environments and custom technical development into one connected platform with a long-term focus on useful systems and scalable capability.</p>
        <div class="page-hero-actions"><a class="page-button page-button-primary" href="/contact">Talk to EVO ↗</a><a class="page-button page-button-secondary" href="/projects">See Our Work</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="page-orb"></div><img src="/hero/evo-hero-spatial.png" alt="" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container page-section-inner">
      <div class="page-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT DRIVES US</p><h2>Real problems first. <span>Technology second.</span></h2></div><p>EVO is not built around one product category. It is built around the ability to understand a problem, combine disciplines and deliver a system that works in practice.</p></div>
      <div class="card-grid-4">
        <article class="value-card"><span>01</span><h3>Practical Engineering</h3><p>Solutions shaped around real operation, maintenance and day-to-day use.</p></article>
        <article class="value-card"><span>02</span><h3>Integrated Thinking</h3><p>Mechanical, electrical, software and control decisions designed to work together.</p></article>
        <article class="value-card"><span>03</span><h3>Smarter Environments</h3><p>Technology that improves homes, buildings and technical spaces without unnecessary complexity.</p></article>
        <article class="value-card"><span>04</span><h3>Long-Term Platform</h3><p>A foundation that can support future products, services and specialized EVO businesses.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="split-section">
    <div class="container split-inner">
      <div class="split-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">HOW WE THINK</p>
        <h2>Engineering across <span>disciplines.</span></h2>
        <p>EVO’s direction combines machine design, industrial controls, software, connected systems and smart living under one engineering mindset. That makes it easier to solve work that does not fit neatly into a single category.</p>
        <div class="feature-list">
          <article><span>01</span><strong>Mechanical + Electrical</strong><p>Physical systems and electrical architecture considered together.</p></article>
          <article><span>02</span><strong>Control + Software</strong><p>PLC, HMI, monitoring and connected application layers.</p></article>
          <article><span>03</span><strong>Site + User Reality</strong><p>Operation, maintenance and user behavior influence the design.</p></article>
          <article><span>04</span><strong>Local + Scalable</strong><p>Built from Sri Lanka with room for broader products and markets.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="split-visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="page-orb"></div><img src="/solutions/solution-custom-engineering.png" alt="" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band"><div class="container cta-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">WORK WITH EVO</p><h2>Build something <span>useful.</span></h2><p>If the work needs engineering, integration or a clearer technical path, start with a conversation.</p></div><a class="page-button page-button-primary" href="/contact">Contact EVO ↗</a></div></section>
</InnerLayout>
